    "N05 verify exact digest of Design/116 canonical bytes and enforce pinned reference identity, not trust",
    "N06 genuine TASK-001 rejected preflight precedence over valid claim or policy; zero core ticks",
    "N07 scenario-injected approved/owner/engine/scheduler/trust/physical sink forbidden by frozen wire schema",
    "N08 accepted valid minimal wire with matching test claim never authorized; always two missing-trust reasons",
    "N09 all 11 claim values mismatch independently and in combination with stable ordered reason tuple",
    "N10 frozen result exact eight fields and three terminal booleans, no exposure of actual authorization token",
    "N11 constant O(1) inspection of accepted scenario header regardless number of events; no event rescan",
    "N12 no filesystem/environment/network/time/random/trace/mixer/ledger/physical device APIs in runtime",
    "N13 neither design trace engine revision nor owner chat approval record grants runtime host binary trust",
    "N14 non-latin strings, control char, Unicode confusables, case/whitespace spoofing in claim deny by strict equality",
    "N15 allowlist cannot be supplied/rotated by scenario, CLI test claim, GUI, environment or user input",
    "N16 deterministic repeated evaluation under locale/TZ/Decimal precision; source data immutable",
    "N17 no HealthVerdict.PASS, ControlVerdict.ADMITTED, FSM changes, accepted RF/control history, snapshot journal calls",
